WEBVTT

00:01.430 --> 00:03.300
Always keep a good poker face.

00:03.300 --> 00:04.970
Taking his father's teaching to heart...

00:04.970 --> 00:07.140
The miraculous magician glides amidst the skyscrapers.

00:07.140 --> 00:08.390
In comes Kaitou Kid!

00:08.890 --> 00:12.100
Today's target is the Last Emperor's Gold Seal.

00:12.100 --> 00:14.610
Now, let the show begin!

01:42.070 --> 01:49.330
Detective Conan is brought to you by these sponsors.

01:56.540 --> 01:57.420
Yo!

01:57.420 --> 01:59.090
I'm Kuroba Kaito.

01:59.090 --> 02:04.430
My dad Kuroba Touichi, who died eight years
ago, was a world-renowned magician.

02:05.380 --> 02:08.680
Ever since I discovered this hidden room behind a poster...

02:08.680 --> 02:11.850
My life has taken a 180-degree turn.

02:11.850 --> 02:15.480
To think the real identity of that
thief of the century, Kaitou Kid...

02:15.480 --> 02:17.190
Was in fact Kuroba Touichi!

02:18.560 --> 02:23.030
In order to ascertain the bastards who
killed my dad, I became Kaitou Kid II...

02:23.030 --> 02:27.240
And decided to steal all of the gems that are
likely to be targeted by those guys, one at a time.

02:28.320 --> 02:31.910
It's a bummer that I have to hide my
trade from my childhood friend Aoko...

02:31.910 --> 02:38.040
But I have no choice since Aoko's old man, Inspector
Nakamori, is all fired up about arresting Kid!

02:39.590 --> 02:43.340
Thievery is still an unfamiliar profession to
me and I'm always kept on tenterhooks...

02:43.340 --> 02:48.090
But until I unravel the truth behind my dad's
death, there's no way I'd give up as Kaitou Kid!

02:48.510 --> 02:50.890
Now, I'm off for today too!

02:54.680 --> 02:59.730
A WITCH SHEDS NO TEARS

03:06.780 --> 03:09.700
Mirror, mirror on the wall...

03:10.370 --> 03:12.910
Who's the fairest of them...

03:15.080 --> 03:15.910
All?

03:17.920 --> 03:20.290
You, Akako-sama, are fairest of all.

03:21.750 --> 03:25.170
All men throughout the world are Akako-sama's captives.

03:26.420 --> 03:28.510
Barring one certain person.

03:28.510 --> 03:30.890
Oh my, who might that be?

03:34.520 --> 03:35.890
Kaitou Kid.

03:38.390 --> 03:40.270
Curses, telling me that again...

03:41.690 --> 03:44.400
My sincere apologies, Akako-sama.

03:45.030 --> 03:48.110
Regarding the ongoing investigation into Kid's true identity...

03:48.110 --> 03:50.490
The mystery still remains unsolved.

03:51.240 --> 03:52.580
I've already figured that out.

04:00.080 --> 04:03.250
One Month Earlier

04:00.330 --> 04:01.420
Please accept this!

04:01.960 --> 04:02.630
Really?

04:03.840 --> 04:05.420
Say, say, Kaito...

04:05.420 --> 04:06.920
Do you want something sweet?

04:06.920 --> 04:08.260
Something sweet?

04:08.260 --> 04:09.050
Yeah.

04:09.050 --> 04:10.180
For example...

04:10.890 --> 04:12.180
Chocolate, or something.

04:13.430 --> 04:16.560
Come to think of it, when I had a toothache a while ago, you...

04:17.470 --> 04:18.850
Owww!

04:19.390 --> 04:22.020
Otafuku — A Japanese folklore character with puffy cheeks

04:19.390 --> 04:20.980
Otafuku, otafuku!

04:22.770 --> 04:23.980
You laughed at me!

04:24.360 --> 04:27.070
I'm not falling for your tricks, idiot!

04:27.070 --> 04:28.150
What are you talking about?

04:28.740 --> 04:30.820
Today is February 14th.

04:31.240 --> 04:33.740
Every girl brought some to school, you know.

04:34.330 --> 04:36.870
Because it's a day for us to give boys chocolates.

04:37.750 --> 04:40.960
Since I figured you're not getting any from the others anyway...

04:41.620 --> 04:44.250
Here, take Aoko's gift just because I pity you.

04:46.670 --> 04:47.340
Keiko!

04:47.590 --> 04:50.970
If you're looking for Kaito-kun, he ran away with a happy face.

04:50.970 --> 04:53.550
﻿I assume you're giving this chocolate to him?

04:53.550 --> 04:54.930
Smooth move right there!

04:55.510 --> 04:57.100
Who'd want to give some to that kind of guy?

04:57.430 --> 05:00.230
How nice, having someone to give it to, Aoko.

05:00.230 --> 05:02.140
I said this is not what you think!

05:02.140 --> 05:04.900
And to think the other boys were all taken...

05:05.400 --> 05:06.440
All taken?

05:06.440 --> 05:07.230
By who?

05:07.230 --> 05:08.940
By the girl who transferred a while ago...

05:10.240 --> 05:11.650
Koizumi Akako.

05:11.650 --> 05:12.610
Akako-sama!

05:12.910 --> 05:13.910
Your chocolate...

05:13.910 --> 05:15.410
May I have the honor?

05:16.660 --> 05:18.700
Everyone, don't push.

05:18.700 --> 05:21.870
I will give—you—one, OK?

05:22.250 --> 05:23.120
Akako-sama!

05:23.120 --> 05:23.830
Please give me one!

05:24.080 --> 05:25.830
Me too, Akako-sama!

05:25.830 --> 05:26.710
Me too please!

05:26.960 --> 05:29.760
What's this, acting as if she were a queen!

05:29.760 --> 05:32.050
But no doubt that Akako-chan is a beauty!

05:33.050 --> 05:35.970
All the boys in the entire world...

05:35.970 --> 05:39.430
Every one of them is my captive.

05:40.640 --> 05:44.600
Mamiko-chan's, Kyouko-chan's, and Momoko-chan's!

05:44.980 --> 05:45.900
Yippee!

05:45.900 --> 05:47.650
I've got a ton of these!

05:48.980 --> 05:49.900
Here, Ono-kun.

05:49.900 --> 05:51.740
You too, Suwa-kun.

05:53.110 --> 05:55.070
Akako-chan, gimme one too!

06:01.910 --> 06:04.210
If you want my chocolate...

06:04.210 --> 06:05.580
You'll need to throw away the others.

06:05.830 --> 06:07.130
Right, right!

06:07.130 --> 06:09.000
Don't be rude to Akako-sama!

06:09.000 --> 06:10.460
Toss them out, toss them out!

06:12.210 --> 06:13.380
Kaito...

06:16.140 --> 06:16.890
Then...

06:17.340 --> 06:18.010
I don't want it.

06:19.390 --> 06:20.390
What the...

06:20.600 --> 06:21.640
Hey!

06:21.640 --> 06:22.890
Get back to your seats!

06:25.140 --> 06:26.310
This is odd.

06:27.230 --> 06:29.150
The only one who won't bow to my whim...

06:29.650 --> 06:31.480
Aoko, didn't you bring some too?

06:29.650 --> 06:32.030
Should be Kaitou Kid...

06:32.230 --> 06:34.190
I don't have anything for Kaito!

06:34.360 --> 06:36.450
Don't tell me, he's actually—!?

06:37.200 --> 06:38.070
I see...

06:38.870 --> 06:40.830
So that's how it is...

06:47.500 --> 06:48.920
Say, Kaito...

06:48.920 --> 06:50.630
Don't you have any idea what day it is?

06:50.630 --> 06:52.090
The date of Kid's manifesto?

06:52.090 --> 06:53.590
I don't mean that!

06:53.590 --> 06:55.590
Whatever, Aoko...

06:55.590 --> 06:56.930
Have you seen my handkerchief?

06:57.380 --> 06:59.930
Geez, always changing the topic like that!

06:59.930 --> 07:02.970
This is weird, I could've sworn I put it right here...

07:11.360 --> 07:14.860
It finally arrived, the night of the full moon I've been waiting for.

07:30.130 --> 07:31.540
A dragon moustache...

07:31.540 --> 07:33.170
Mermaid tears...

07:33.170 --> 07:34.920
A kappa's eyeball — bring them.

07:39.550 --> 07:42.810
And I hereby immolate Kuroba Kaito's substitute...

07:42.810 --> 07:44.560
This handkerchief, to thee!

07:48.060 --> 07:49.810
O the Realm of Hell...

07:49.810 --> 07:52.270
Ye who dominate in tenebrosity...

07:52.270 --> 07:53.440
Bring me power.

07:53.770 --> 07:55.360
Bring me power.

07:55.730 --> 07:58.070
Milady Akako is...

07:58.070 --> 08:03.280
Truly the rightful successor to the Red
Magic passed down from our ancestors.

08:03.490 --> 08:06.330
Bless her with power at once!

08:07.450 --> 08:09.790
The satanic adversary of darkness...

08:09.790 --> 08:12.290
The lord of fiery purgatory who defied heaven...

08:12.290 --> 08:14.170
I call upon thee, Lucifer!

08:15.130 --> 08:19.550
Reveal at once thine egregious figure and answer to my inquiries!

08:21.800 --> 08:23.720
Rise, Lucifer!

08:23.720 --> 08:25.350
Come forth unto me!

08:33.730 --> 08:34.900
Who was it?

08:34.900 --> 08:37.480
Which ignorant of a soul dareth summon me?

08:37.990 --> 08:40.450
O answer me, Lucifer!

08:40.450 --> 08:42.030
What Kaitou Kid's demise may be!

08:42.870 --> 08:47.910
Thou who wishest to sin on a full moon
night shalt create a path in the sky...

08:47.910 --> 08:51.710
And conceal thyself at the tower of scarlet so high.

08:51.710 --> 08:54.960
Thou who darest command upon me...

08:54.960 --> 08:56.250
Who art thou?

08:57.460 --> 08:58.340
Enough already.

08:58.340 --> 08:59.050
Vamoose.

09:03.760 --> 09:07.390
To that vexatious Kid who refused to turn to me...

09:07.390 --> 09:09.390
I shall expunge you from this world.

09:09.390 --> 09:15.060
After I've done so, the remaining men from
all over the world will become my slaves.

09:15.060 --> 09:15.860
My mind puppets!

09:19.650 --> 09:21.490
Has the you-know-what been completed?

09:22.070 --> 09:23.360
As you can see.

09:25.120 --> 09:26.280
Just an extra precaution.

09:31.500 --> 09:34.330
I still couldn't muster the courage to give it him today.

09:34.630 --> 09:37.420
And a month has flown by just like that...

09:37.420 --> 09:39.050
I'm a stupid Aoko.

09:39.050 --> 09:41.380
And I can't possibly keep it until next year...

09:42.550 --> 09:44.180
What do I do?

09:51.390 --> 09:52.890
Awesome!

09:53.190 --> 09:54.980
Wonderful!

09:55.350 --> 09:57.560
Inspector, everyone is in position.

09:57.900 --> 09:59.730
Listen up, hold your fire.

09:59.730 --> 10:00.820
It's imperative to capture him alive!

10:01.320 --> 10:01.990
Roger!

10:04.820 --> 10:06.870
Damn, that bastard Kid...

10:06.870 --> 10:08.740
I'm definitely gonna catch you today!

10:07.320 --> 10:10.740
ADVANCE NOTICE
TONIGHT, AT PRECISELY 0:00,
I SHALL ARRIVE AND ACQUIRE
THE LAST EMPEROR'S SEAL
IN THE MAINLAND DYNASTY
EXHIBITION!
KAITOU KID ♥

10:12.750 --> 10:15.290
Oh, a full moon tonight?

10:20.590 --> 10:21.170
Who's there!?

10:27.930 --> 10:30.510
I'll let you in on something good, Inspector.

10:31.350 --> 10:35.190
Today marks the inevitable death of Kaitou Kid.

10:58.240 --> 10:59.530
Odd...

10:59.530 --> 11:01.660
I have an ominous feeling about today.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.620
Just kidding!

11:14.920 --> 11:15.790
Inspector!

11:15.790 --> 11:16.960
Where have you been?

11:16.960 --> 11:18.010
At a time as important as this!

11:19.550 --> 11:20.510
Shut up.

11:20.510 --> 11:22.380
It's my liberty to go wherever I want.

11:23.180 --> 11:24.260
Inspector?

11:32.350 --> 11:33.400
Here goes!

11:36.770 --> 11:37.320
Over here?

11:46.530 --> 11:47.950
Kaitou Kid!

11:48.910 --> 11:50.200
This is bad, isn't it?

11:53.750 --> 11:55.630
See ya later!

11:57.630 --> 12:00.010
Don't let him escape!

12:09.310 --> 12:10.600
Move over, move over!

12:14.060 --> 12:15.270
What the hell are you doing!?

12:15.270 --> 12:16.190
Stop that bastard!

12:16.190 --> 12:17.610
I don't care if you shoot him down!

12:17.770 --> 12:18.690
Shoot him?

12:18.690 --> 12:19.610
Give way!

12:22.440 --> 12:23.280
This is weird...

12:23.280 --> 12:25.280
What's wrong with the inspector today?

12:29.450 --> 12:30.870
DIE, DIE!

12:36.380 --> 12:38.040
Hell yeah, it's a hit!

12:39.800 --> 12:40.880
Wrong...

12:41.380 --> 12:43.340
Every single bullet missed...

12:43.840 --> 12:44.800
This pain is...

13:10.870 --> 13:12.950
KID!

13:15.250 --> 13:16.040
Damn!

13:18.580 --> 13:20.000
Die, Kid!

13:23.170 --> 13:27.680
Thou who wishest to sin on a full moon night...

13:27.680 --> 13:29.930
Shalt create a path in the sky...

13:29.930 --> 13:33.310
And conceal thyself at the tower of scarlet so high.

13:42.610 --> 13:43.690
What's this!?

13:44.440 --> 13:46.610
I've been waiting for you, Kuroba Kaito.

13:46.950 --> 13:49.820
Or should I say, "Kaitou Kid" instead?

13:51.160 --> 13:52.620
Don't tell me...

13:53.240 --> 13:54.290
Akako!

13:54.290 --> 13:56.620
Still, the results are the same.

13:58.120 --> 14:00.710
You'll become a nobody once you die.

14:03.550 --> 14:06.470
I see, this pain was your doing...

14:06.470 --> 14:07.590
Yes.

14:07.590 --> 14:11.760
I am the legitimate successor to the Red Magic sect, Mr. Thief.

14:11.760 --> 14:15.270
Tonight, I shall be the one to steal your soul!

14:16.270 --> 14:19.140
I am extremely honored to hear that.

14:19.140 --> 14:22.770
But with that kind of wardrobe, you'll catch a cold...

14:22.770 --> 14:23.570
Young miss!

14:26.690 --> 14:27.190
Here goes.

14:30.200 --> 14:30.910
What?

14:31.450 --> 14:31.910
A blackout?

15:28.630 --> 15:29.670
This is...

15:30.130 --> 15:31.170
A magic circle!?

15:32.630 --> 15:33.590
I can't move!

15:35.260 --> 15:36.970
You fell into my trap, Kid!

15:36.970 --> 15:39.850
Your body has already become my possession.

15:39.850 --> 15:41.890
Whether I let you live or kill you is all up to me.

15:42.230 --> 15:45.310
Now, are you going to be my slave...

15:45.310 --> 15:47.570
Or be annihilated from here for good?

15:47.570 --> 15:48.940
Select one of those options now.

15:54.990 --> 15:56.030
This is...

15:56.580 --> 15:57.780
What's going on?

15:57.910 --> 16:00.620
Kid!

16:02.580 --> 16:04.080
Inspector!

16:04.080 --> 16:07.960
You're not getting away, Kid!

16:12.880 --> 16:14.220
Geez...

16:14.220 --> 16:16.340
What a selfish young miss you are!

16:16.340 --> 16:19.100
I wonder how long you can put up a façade like that?

16:19.850 --> 16:22.560
Now, become my slave!

16:28.820 --> 16:29.520
Hot...

16:31.230 --> 16:31.860
Kid...

16:32.440 --> 16:35.280
You want to be freed from that pain, don't you?

16:35.280 --> 16:38.870
In that case, take a bite from this chocolate.

16:38.870 --> 16:41.410
I bet you can be saved that way.

16:41.580 --> 16:43.160
In exchange...

16:43.160 --> 16:44.960
Your mind will...

16:44.960 --> 16:47.130
Forever become mine, you know?

16:55.930 --> 16:58.430
Now, why the hesitation, Kid?

16:58.430 --> 16:59.720
Hurry and eat it!

17:02.430 --> 17:05.020
Kid!

17:08.060 --> 17:08.940
It's snowing...

17:17.530 --> 17:19.120
Young miss...

17:19.120 --> 17:21.330
Your magic spell has already...

17:21.330 --> 17:22.410
Lost its effect!

17:26.160 --> 17:26.830
Snow!?

17:27.620 --> 17:28.880
The snow's falling on my magic circle...

17:48.140 --> 17:50.610
The spring snow which is out of season...

17:51.770 --> 17:54.230
Is the kind of magic from the whimsical Mother Nature.

17:54.730 --> 17:55.650
Magic?

17:56.610 --> 17:58.950
So that's your trump card, is it?

17:58.950 --> 18:00.910
Always escaping with magic tricks whenever you're in a pinch.

18:01.990 --> 18:05.120
But magic tricks are just lies and illusions!

18:05.120 --> 18:07.290
To think you'd deceive people with that...

18:07.290 --> 18:10.080
My spells aren't lies, illusions, or coincidences!

18:10.080 --> 18:11.580
They're real!

18:11.580 --> 18:13.090
They really come true, you know!?

18:13.670 --> 18:14.750
Right.

18:14.750 --> 18:16.510
That's what I think, too.

18:21.050 --> 18:22.010
You're escaping!?

18:23.180 --> 18:30.270
While it may be true that magic tricks utilize lies, illusions,
and coincidences with the purpose to deceive people...

18:30.520 --> 18:33.230
Those who are watching said magic tricks...

18:33.230 --> 18:34.110
Silence!

18:49.120 --> 18:51.290
Enjoy the fact that they're being deceived.

18:52.330 --> 18:56.250
Even if you use magic spells to rob
people's minds, you'll only become lonely.

18:57.380 --> 18:58.170
But...

18:58.720 --> 19:01.760
Resorting to force to rob them is what witches do.

19:05.720 --> 19:07.220
Kid!

19:25.740 --> 19:26.450
Kid...

19:34.670 --> 19:38.920
You are the one who's lying to your own heart.

19:41.050 --> 19:43.640
A thief is not to be made light of.

19:43.640 --> 19:46.930
Deep inside that freezing heart shut tight...

19:46.930 --> 19:50.430
The fact that there rests a beautiful gem is apparent to me.

19:53.230 --> 19:53.980
Kid...

20:06.370 --> 20:09.330
Goodbye, my dear cute witch.

20:23.050 --> 20:23.840
Kid...

20:26.850 --> 20:29.890
My sincere apologies, milady...

20:29.890 --> 20:37.150
I forgot to inform you of the weather forecast that suggested
there might be unseasonable spring snow coming down tonight.

20:37.440 --> 20:40.730
But, Kid probably already figured that out.

20:41.570 --> 20:44.400
Deep inside that freezing heart shut tight...

20:44.400 --> 20:48.700
The fact that there rests a beautiful gem is apparent to me.

20:53.500 --> 20:54.460
Milady!

20:57.290 --> 20:58.290
I know very well.

20:58.960 --> 21:00.460
If a witch should shed a tear...

21:01.250 --> 21:02.880
She'll lose all of her magic powers.

21:04.130 --> 21:06.630
I'll never forget the legend passed down from my ancestors.

21:08.010 --> 21:10.850
Plus, magicians are the ones...

21:10.850 --> 21:15.140
Who recreate magic spells and powers by
means of magic tricks and rely on trickery...

21:15.140 --> 21:17.900
While acting condescendingly towards many witches.

21:17.900 --> 21:19.440
They are our archenemies!

21:36.040 --> 21:39.330
Why the heck am I up here!?

21:40.750 --> 21:44.380
HELP MEEEE!

21:48.340 --> 21:49.010
Good morning.

21:49.010 --> 21:51.300
I was so surprised by the snow yesterday!

21:51.300 --> 21:53.470
The weather forecast guessed it right after all!

21:56.390 --> 21:57.390
So hungry...

21:58.390 --> 21:59.560
Isn't that chocolate?

22:00.100 --> 22:01.310
I'll accept it!

22:01.900 --> 22:02.570
That's...

22:02.570 --> 22:05.280
Already well past its expiration date...

22:05.280 --> 22:08.360
And since today's White Day, it really
should be the other way around...

22:08.660 --> 22:09.990
Delicious!

22:09.990 --> 22:11.160
What's "the other way around"?

22:13.160 --> 22:14.830
It's nothing, it's nothing!

22:16.000 --> 22:17.250
Weird girl.

22:20.170 --> 22:22.210
This is so awesome, where'd you get it?

22:22.210 --> 22:24.590
I'll show you someday, Kuroba Kaito.

22:25.050 --> 22:26.300
No, Kaitou Ki...

22:26.300 --> 22:27.510
Akako-sama!

22:28.050 --> 22:30.260
This is my Valentine's return gift!

22:30.260 --> 22:31.760
Akako-sama!

22:31.760 --> 22:32.600
Take mine too!

24:06.310 --> 24:18.080
NEXT EPISODE

24:07.230 --> 24:10.280
Once the clock's chime signifying the
final time reverberates in the dark...

24:10.280 --> 24:12.740
The Guardian of Time will deliver their punishment.

24:12.740 --> 24:14.610
What's the true identity of the invisible culprit?

24:15.110 --> 24:17.160
A case will occur at precisely 6:00!

24:18.450 --> 24:21.330
THE GUARDIAN OF TIME'S SWORD

24:18.450 --> 24:21.330
(PART ONE)

24:22.290 --> 24:29.880
Detective Conan was brought to you by these sponsors.

24:36.550 --> 24:41.270
Six o'Clock

24:37.470 --> 24:39.390
Next Conan's Hint

24:41.270 --> 24:46.270
LOOK FORWARD TO THE NEXT EPISODE

24:41.520 --> 24:44.190
Speaking of 6:00 PM,
it's the time when
Detective Conan
starts!

24:44.190 --> 24:45.350
Excluding some
locations.

24:45.350 --> 24:45.900
Stay tuned!
